# Session lifecycle of the milestone-3 server: connect and Bootstrap, liveness,
# a voluntary disconnect that clears the mirror, a reconnect that bootstraps it
# again, and a Shutdown the server honours by closing the socket.
#
# Run against `scivisStudioServer --library helide --data-root <tmp>`; the
# runner (run_scenario.sh) passes --port, so `connect` names no endpoint.

connect
assert state == Connected

# The Bootstrap filled the Structural Mirror and the Project Replica.
assert scene.objects >= 1
assert scene.cameras >= 1
assert project.shots >= 1
assert project.activeShot != ""

# Ping/Pong liveness: the Pong answers within the deadline.
ping
expect-pong

# Disconnected is a completed intention: mirror and replica are gone.
disconnect
assert state == Disconnected
assert scene.objects == 0

# A reconnect is a fresh handshake and Bootstrap to the same endpoint.
reconnect
assert state == Connected
assert scene.objects >= 1
assert scene.cameras >= 1
assert project.shots >= 1
assert project.activeShot != ""

# Shutdown: the server closes the socket, which lands us in Disconnected.
shutdown
assert state == Disconnected
